stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Unavailable: mount and clear
  Unavailable --> Empty: empty snapshot
  Empty --> Visible: ready snapshot
  Visible --> Partial: partial refresh
  Partial --> Visible: ready refresh
  Visible --> Unavailable: invalid snapshot or session clear
  Visible --> Filtered: clock advances and refresh
  Filtered --> Visible: refreshed future meetings
  Visible --> Fitted: rail shrinks
  Fitted --> Visible: rail grows
  Visible --> Calendar: activate day link
  Visible --> Detached: parent removes panel and clears
